From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ps5sd <ps5sd@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] server: the preset's CLIP skip, prompt starters and name;
 images that are not kept

sd_server_set_preset_extras sets more of the loaded preset at run time: its
CLIP skip (a request default), its prompt starters (put before the prompt
and the negative prompt of every request, once) and its name (into each
saved image's parameters as "Preset:" and "ps5sd": {"preset"}). An img_gen
or vid_gen request with "temporary": true is saved as tmp_<name>: served,
but in the gallery's list only with temporary=1.
---
